(Japanese: '''ポケットモンスターSPECIAL ルビー・サファイア 2''' ''{{tt|Pocket Monster Special|Pokémon Adventures}} Ruby Sapphire volume 2'') is the second volume of an omnibus compilation of the {{MangaArc|Ruby & Sapphire}} of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga authored by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and illustrated by [[Satoshi Yamamoto]].

This volume is released under [[Shogakukan]]'s "My First Series" (マイファーストシリーズ) brand, which are bargain-priced volumes sold only in Japanese convenience stores. It has no connection to the discontinued 2011 omnibus release of the {{MangaArc|Ruby & Sapphire}}.

